# A new chat's first words sent on a phone (MBUI_FIXTURE=newchat; MBUI_CORE_MS as late as a phone's core): its scene
# fading from the send, the words going up into their bubble with the chat's list coming up out of the composer
# (sfpages new_chat.mbt, sfbase flight.mbt).
timeout 20000
wait 1200
tap 做任何事
wait 500
type 把发布说明写一下
wait 700
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 2000
